 The original response remains available. Evidence maps, multiple suggestions,
 required acknowledgements and executable suggestions retain their normal
 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+`spiral-coder coupled-status --run-dir PATH` owns no new persistent state. It is a
+read-only projection of the native `iterations.json` manifest and each
+iteration's `state/tui-work.json` ledger. Wire usage counts every durable request;
+task usage counts `charge: "task"`, with omitted charge using the native task
+default. A missing interrupted ledger means unknown usage (`null`), never zero;
+declared limits remain known. Recorded native completion is an operator status,
+not independent verification, qualification, or promotion authorization.
